{"transcript":"ɔːˈdiːl","exists":true,"definitions":["A prolonged and painful or horrific experience.","An ancient test of guilt or innocence by subjection to severe physical pain."],"examples":["The hostage's ordeal lasted weeks.","She survived the terrible ordeal.","Trial by ordeal was common."],"lemma":"ordeal","lemmaPos":"noun","synonyms":["trial","tribulation","trauma","nightmare","adversity"],"number":"singular","pluralForm":"ordeals","source":"ordeal"}